This extension adds Unreal Tournament 2004 modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]GOG[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named one of: "Animations", "Benchmark", "ForceFeedback", "Help", "KarmaData", "Maps", "Music", "Sounds", "Speech", "StaticMeshes", "System", "SystemLocalized", "Textures", "Web" or "Saves" and a file with one of these extensions: "...ANIMATIONS_EXTS", "...KARMADATA_EXTS", "...MAPS_EXTS", "...MUSIC_EXTS", "...SOUNDS_EXTS", "...SPEECH_EXTS", "...STATICMESHES_EXTS", "...SYSTEM_EXTS", "...TEXTURES_EXTS" or "...SAVES_EXTS".[/*]
[*]Any other mod not described above is installed to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]Archives with a FOMOD installer (a "fomod" folder with ModuleConfig.xml) are handed to Vortex's built-in FOMOD installer instead.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

